; The `metaocaml` findlib library, made correct for bytecode linking under dune.
; Depend on this instead of on `metaocaml` directly. It has no modules; it only
; adds the compiler-libs that metaocaml's META lists under `requires(byte)`,
; which dune does not evaluate, in the order linking needs. See
; docs/ARCHITECTURE.md, "Dune ignores requires(byte)".

(library
 (name metaocaml_byte)
 (modules)
 (libraries compiler-libs.bytecomp compiler-libs.toplevel metaocaml))
